  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "Propose one executable offline metadata feature for the PUBLIC request. Return feature5.2 JSON only. Every plan explicitly chooses result_use: value / unavailable / unavailable_or_zero. Preserve source, requested filters, output rows and population. Do not replace an unsupported analysis with an easier calculation. You choose purpose, narrow meaning, calculation expression and result_use. For a calculation-result availability request, expression computes the requested value/comparison and result_use=unavailable checks that result. Do not enumerate missing causes with nullable OR. For unavailable-or-known-zero of a numeric result, select result_use=unavailable_or_zero. Result views are typed common compiler operations; they are not hidden fixes. Describe the selected final output, with no invented empty-case values; code infers types/units/missing policies/IDs/SHA. Never guess operational meaning from raw codes or unknown units. Physical parent existence is not a mandatory-parent business contract. A valid calculation may be constant or have no selected observations. If source, relation or an exact supported expression is unavailable, return candidates=[] with a precise complete stop_reason.\nSupported expression nodes: column(op,table,column), literal(op,value), is_missing(args1), subtract/divide/eq/lt/lte/gt/gte/and/or(args2), not(args1), in/not_in(args1,values homogeneous1..32 literals), if(args3), datetime_diff(args2,unit=ms/s/us), convert_unit(args1,from_unit,to_unit), child_count/parent_match_count(relationship_id), conditional_count(relationship_id,where), child_sum(relationship_id,value,where), group_count(keys,where). No add/abs or parent attribute lookup. Use JSON null, not string null.\nRelations are child/from -> parent/to. child_count, conditional_count, child_sum output PARENT rows; parent_match_count outputs CHILD rows. All nonliteral operands share output rows, including if's condition and branches. Grain keys identify output rows, not all source columns. group_by lists only actual group_count keys. A known empty child aggregate is0, missing relationship/key/predicate propagates unavailable. Division by0 is unavailable, never numeric0. is_missing tests any nested result and returns complete true/false on retained rows. and/or strictly propagate any unavailable operand; true OR unavailable is unavailable. if validates both branches, then lazily evaluates only the selected branch; unavailable condition stays unavailable. Filter-excluded or unknown-selection rows produce no output, not false or unavailable values. Do not hide invalid sources, types or execution errors as missingness.\nThe calculation component and final inspected output are distinct: never wrap the expression in a missingness test merely because result_use already requests unavailable. A public calculation_type constrains the inner value/comparison, not the final view. Keep one concise complete meaning sentence about the final view; detailed branch/empty-group behavior is recorded by compiler facts. Write purpose and meaning in English; quote original literal tokens when needed, but do not switch languages in explanatory prose. needed_evidence must not list unrelated supplied unit IDs. Write short COMPLETE purpose<=200, meaning<=320, stop_reason<=320. Prefer one concise meaning sentence around150–220 characters; do not repeat the whole plan or append a long branch-by-branch narrative. Explain calculation, filters, output row and result states. True0 differs from no evaluable rows. Raw IN/OUT/MAP/VOID/UNKNOWN have no business meaning beyond supplied authority. No fault/normality/SLA/online claim follows from offline metadata."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"contract\":\"offline-specification-final1.0\",\"task\":\"Compute physical FRAME_REGISTER match count for each HOP_TRACE row. Return true for unavailable or known0, false for known nonzero count. Use the explicit result view, not a parent child-count analysis.\",\"analysis_request\":{\"output_table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"result_use\":\"unavailable_or_zero\",\"calculation_type\":\"number\",\"required_columns\":[],\"required_relationship_ids\":[\"hop_frame_link\"],\"complete_boolean\":true},\"schema_inventory\":[{\"table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"primary_key\":[\"FRAME_ROW\"],\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"FRAME_ROW\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"JOIN_VALUE\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"}]},{\"table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"primary_key\":[\"TRACE_ROW\"],\"columns\":[{\"name\":\"TRACE_ROW\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"FRAME_REF\",\"type\":\"string\",\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"\"}]}],\"relationships\":[{\"id\":\"hop_frame_link\",\"from_table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"from_columns\":[\"TENANT_CODE\",\"FRAME_REF\"],\"to_table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"to_columns\":[\"TENANT_CODE\",\"JOIN_VALUE\"],\"no_reference_values\":[]}],\"relationship_operator_domains\":[{\"relationship_id\":\"hop_frame_link\",\"child_row_table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"parent_row_table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"child_count_conditional_count_child_sum_output\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"parent_match_count_output\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"no_implicit_row_conversion\":true}],\"profile\":{\"period\":{\"controlled_domain\":\"Artificial rows; no operational dates\"},\"table_rows\":{\"FRAME_REGISTER\":2,\"HOP_TRACE\":4},\"transaction_families\":0,\"metadata\":{\"FRAME_REGISTER\":[{\"column\":\"FRAME_ROW\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":2,\"missing\":0,\"distinct\":2},{\"column\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":2,\"missing\":0,\"distinct\":1},{\"column\":\"JOIN_VALUE\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":2,\"missing\":0,\"distinct\":1}],\"HOP_TRACE\":[{\"column\":\"TRACE_ROW\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":4,\"missing\":0,\"distinct\":4,\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"No confirmed business meaning supplied\"},{\"column\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":4,\"missing\":1,\"distinct\":1,\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"No confirmed business meaning supplied\"},{\"column\":\"FRAME_REF\",\"logical_type\":\"string\",\"rows\":4,\"missing\":1,\"distinct\":2,\"unit\":{\"name\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\"},\"description\":\"No confirmed business meaning supplied\"}]},\"observed_extrema_not_proven_bounds\":true,\"full_source_pins\":[{\"table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"sha256\":\"03dfc0690e8d80591db82b2eae0f756f6fb2798b959fc35d1e327a7a7068a9ae\",\"bytes\":56},{\"table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"sha256\":\"ae374597023b9d4b49d3cc8dead6b653bb24c2067d5478a45f0115561a256c7c\",\"bytes\":74}],\"coverage\":[{\"table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"column\":\"FRAME_ROW\",\"detailed_observation\":false},{\"table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"column\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"detailed_observation\":false},{\"table\":\"FRAME_REGISTER\",\"column\":\"JOIN_VALUE\",\"detailed_observation\":false},{\"table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"column\":\"TRACE_ROW\",\"detailed_observation\":true},{\"table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"column\":\"TENANT_CODE\",\"detailed_observation\":true},{\"table\":\"HOP_TRACE\",\"column\":\"FRAME_REF\",\"detailed_observation\":true}],\"full_profile_sha\":\"c5ae958c057d7dec14d30cbd8ab0209b3cc3b16a3eee07451aaa328658f33f7e\",\"selection_policy\":\"Full schema/type/unit/relation inventory and rows/missing/distinct for every column; detailed values for public output table and required operands. Full profile is archived; no row sampling or token truncation.\"},\"source\":{\"source_version\":\"c7fdeaacb68ac6ef68b01f651707e6aad95f42e6bc0726106a38f1cd49077ea1\",\"manifest_sha\":\"ce9496b6d1cfcb83ddecf2a36d1008db89e856b9918d0b83f3342eb61d9fe29d\",\"data_class\":\"controlled\",\"period\":{\"controlled_domain\":\"Artificial rows; no operational dates\"}},\"confirmed_constraints\":[],\"confirmed_authority\":[],\"unknown\":[\"No mandatory parent, fault label, or online contract.\"],\"guarded_conditional_contract\":{\"version\":\"guarded-conditional1.1-null-branches\",\"AST\":{\"op\":\"if\",\"args\":[\"Boolean condition\",\"value if true\",\"value if false\"]},\"condition\":\"Boolean; unavailable condition yields unavailable, never the false branch\",\"branches\":\"Both branches validated statically; same type/unit and output row, literal scalar broadcast only. At runtime evaluate only the chosen branch.\",\"result\":\"Chosen branch value, including unavailable; no exception-to-null conversion\",\"legacy\":\"All old operators and old definition hashes retain their original policy. Only plans containing if add conditional_extension to identity.\",\"errors\":\"Invalid source/type/unit/relationship rejected before execution, even if branch not selected. Runtime exceptions in the chosen branch propagate.\",\"no_AST_rewrite\":true},\"result_view_contract\":{\"version\":\"result-view1.0\",\"value\":\"Use expression value, preserving unavailable.\",\"unavailable\":\"Complete Boolean: true when expression result unavailable, false when it is available, including numeric0 and Booleanfalse.\",\"unavailable_or_zero\":\"Complete Boolean for numeric expression: true if unavailable or known0, false for a known nonzero value.\",\"scope\":\"All views apply only to retained output rows; invalid sources/types/software failures are errors. Explicit null branch adopts only the other concrete branch type/unit.\"},\"supported_operators_from_schema\":true,\"existing_definitions_for_dedup_only\":[]}"
    }
